[
    {
        "text": "Never be ashamed of trying. Effortlessness is a myth.",
        "type": "quote",
        "author": "Taylor Swift",
        "source": "2022 NYU Commencement Address"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your life is going to be full of mistakes, and I hope that you make them.",
        "type": "quote",
        "author": "Taylor Swift",
        "source": "2022 NYU Commencement Address"
    },
    {
        "text": "Learn to live alongside cringe.",
        "type": "quote",
        "author": "Taylor Swift",
        "source": "2022 NYU Commencement Address"
    },
    {
        "text": "Whatever you do in life, be nice to people.",
        "type": "quote",
        "author": "Taylor Swift",
        "source": "2022 NYU Commencement Address"
    },
    {
        "text": "Being nice to people, being kind, being empathetic is a way of showing people that you care.",
        "type": "quote",
        "author": "Taylor Swift",
        "source": "2022 NYU Commencement Address"
    },
    {
        "text": "Make the mistakes that make you grow.",
        "type": "quote",
        "author": "Taylor Swift",
        "source": "2022 NYU Commencement Address"
    },
    {
        "text": "Accept the fact that you're going to be wrong.",
        "type": "quote",
        "author": "Taylor Swift",
        "source": "2022 NYU Commencement Address"
    },
    {
        "text": "No matter how hard you try to avoid it, you will inevitably stumble.",
        "type": "quote",
        "author": "Taylor Swift",
        "source": "2022 NYU Commencement Address"
    },
    {
        "text": "You are now doing something that is very scary and very brave and very hard.",
        "type": "quote",
        "author": "Taylor Swift",
        "source": "2022 NYU Commencement Address"
    },
    {
        "text": "I leave you with this: We are all writers.",
        "type": "quote",
        "author": "Taylor Swift",
        "source": "2022 NYU Commencement Address"
    },
    {
        "text": "Life can be heavy, especially if you try to carry it all at once.",
        "type": "quote",
        "author": "Taylor Swift",
        "source": "2022 NYU Commencement Address"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've been making mistakes since I was 15. I've made a lot of them.",
        "type": "quote",
        "author": "Taylor Swift",
        "source": "2022 NYU Commencement Address"
    }
